---
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
---

<SubpageLayout title="About" breadcrumbs={[{ label: "About" }]}>
  <!-- Hero: Background Image -->
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="about-hero__inner">
      <h1 class="hero__headline">About Zo Media<br />Productions</h1>
      <p class="hero__subhead">A cooperative publishing house amplifying incarcerated voices through literature, film, and art.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Story -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow reveal">
      <span class="label">Our Story</span>
      <h2>Built From the Inside Out</h2>
      <p class="text-lg" style="margin-top: var(--space-lg);">Zo Media Productions was founded as a subsidiary of the United Black Family Scholarship Foundation (UBFSF), a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization. What began as a single publication has grown into a full cooperative media house — publishing books, producing film, and exhibiting visual art created by incarcerated people across the country.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: var(--space-md);">We exist because the stories coming from inside prison walls are some of the most urgent, honest, and necessary narratives in American culture. These are not charity projects. They are works of literature, cinema, and art that stand on their own merit — created by people who happen to be incarcerated.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: var(--space-md);">Every title we publish, every film we produce, and every exhibition we mount generates real economic opportunity for the creator while opening a window into a system most Americans will never see firsthand.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Cooperative Model -->
  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container reveal">
      <span class="label">How We Work</span>
      <h2 class="text-center">The Cooperative Model</h2>
      <div class="grid grid--asymmetric" style="margin-top: var(--space-2xl);">
        <div>
          <h3>Co-Chair Partnership</h3>
          <p class="text-lg" style="margin-top: var(--space-md);">Every leadership position at Zo Media is co-held by two people: an inside member — someone currently or formerly incarcerated — and an outside member, typically a student volunteer or community advocate.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: var(--space-md);">This is not symbolic. Both co-chairs share equal decision-making authority over editorial direction, project selection, and organizational strategy. The model ensures that the people whose stories we publish are never separated from the power to shape how those stories reach the world.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-2xl);">
          <div class="signal-line"></div>
          <h3 class="card__title">Revenue Model</h3>
          <p class="card__text" style="margin-top: var(--space-md);"><strong style="color: var(--color-wire);">50%</strong> of all profits go directly to the UBFSF Community Grant Fund, which supports education, reentry programs, and family assistance for incarcerated individuals.</p>
          <p class="card__text" style="margin-top: var(--space-sm);">The remaining revenue is shared among creators and reinvested into new projects — keeping the cooperative self-sustaining and creator-owned.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Values -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container reveal">
      <span class="label">What We Stand For</span>
      <h2 class="text-center">Our Values</h2>
      <div class="grid grid--3" style="margin-top: var(--space-2xl);">
        <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-xl);">
          <div class="signal-line"></div>
          <h3 class="card__title">Creative Excellence</h3>
          <p class="card__text">We publish work that meets the highest editorial and artistic standards. Incarceration does not diminish talent — it sharpens perspective. Our creators produce literature, film, and art that competes on any shelf, any screen, any wall.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-xl);">
          <div class="signal-line"></div>
          <h3 class="card__title">Economic Equity</h3>
          <p class="card__text">Creators earn from their work. The cooperative model ensures that the people who make the art share in its success — not as an afterthought, but as a founding principle. Revenue flows back to communities, not shareholders.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-xl);">
          <div class="signal-line"></div>
          <h3 class="card__title">Justice Reform</h3>
          <p class="card__text">Every publication is an act of advocacy. By centering incarcerated voices in mainstream culture, we challenge the narratives that sustain mass incarceration and build public will for systemic change.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- UBFSF Parent Org -->
  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container container--narrow text-center reveal">
      <span class="label">Our Parent Organization</span>
      <h2>United Black Family Scholarship Foundation</h2>
      <p class="text-lg" style="margin-top: var(--space-lg);">Zo Media Productions operates as a subsidiary of UBFSF, a registered 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization dedicated to education, family support, and community development for incarcerated individuals and their families.</p>
      <div class="divider" style="margin: var(--space-xl) auto;">
        <span class="divider__label">Contact UBFSF</span>
      </div>
      <p style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-fog);">
        United Black Family Scholarship Foundation<br />
        P.O. Box 862, Bristow, OK 74010
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SubpageLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 50vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    background: url('/assets/images/zo-media/folsom-tower.jpeg') center/cover no-repeat;
  }
  .about-hero::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      rgba(10, 10, 11, 0.5) 0%,
      rgba(10, 10, 11, 0.85) 100%
    );
  }
  .about-hero__inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: var(--container-max);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: var(--space-3xl) var(--grid-margin) var(--space-2xl);
    width: 100%;
  }
</style>
